   "text": "Momcozy Official New Release | All In One M5 Smart Wearable Breast Pump | New M5 Breast Pump With App Control | Painlessly Pump With High Efficiency | Same Price But Upgraded with App Control | Momcozy New Release - M5 All In One Smart Wearable Breast Pump | 2026 New In M5 Smart Hands Free Breast Pump - Upgraded with App Control | Great Price From $119.99, Pay in 4 Installments, Interest Free. | Pump a new horizontal angle, just like a baby mouth’s suckling | 3 modes & 9 levels for pumping choices, weighs only 230g at 2/3 size of normal pumps",
